<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Resume - Your Name</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #6b46c1;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #6b46c1;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #805ad5;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .contact-info {
            background: #f7fafc;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .job, .education {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .job h3, .education h3 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #4a5568;
        }
        .date {
            color: #718096;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        ul {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Your Name</h1>
    
    <div class="contact-info">
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> your.email@example.com</p>
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong> (123) 456-7890</p>
        <p><strong>Location:</strong> Your City, Country</p>
        <p><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> linkedin.com/in/yourprofile</p>
        <p><strong>GitHub:</strong> github.com/yourusername</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
        <p>
            Passionate Full Stack Developer with 3+ years of experience building modern web applications
            using the MERN stack. Expertise in creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces and scalable
            backend systems. Strong problem-solving skills and a commitment to writing clean, maintainable code.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> React, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Responsive Design</li>
            <li><strong>Backend:</strong> Node.js, Express.js, RESTful APIs</li>
            <li><strong>Database:</strong> MongoDB, MySQL</li>
            <li><strong>Tools:</strong> Git, Docker, VS Code, Postman</li>
            <li><strong>Other:</strong> Agile/Scrum, CI/CD, Testing</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Work Experience</h2>
        
        <div class="job">
            <h3>Full Stack Developer</h3>
            <p class="date">Company Name | Jan 2022 - Present</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Developed and maintained web applications using MERN stack</li>
                <li>Collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality software</li>
                <li>Implemented responsive designs and optimized application performance</li>
                <li>Participated in code reviews and mentored junior developers</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="job">
            <h3>Junior Web Developer</h3>
            <p class="date">Previous Company | Jun 2020 - Dec 2021</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Built responsive web interfaces using React and modern CSS</li>
                <li>Integrated third-party APIs and services</li>
                <li>Worked with backend team to design and implement RESTful APIs</li>
                <li>Participated in agile development processes</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Education</h2>
        
        <div class="education">
            <h3>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</h3>
            <p class="date">University Name | 2016 - 2020</p>
            <p>Relevant coursework: Data Structures, Algorithms, Web Development, Database Systems</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        
        <div class="job">
            <h3>Portfolio Website</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Built a modern, responsive portfolio website using React and Node.js</li>
                <li>Implemented dark/light theme toggle and smooth animations</li>
                <li>Integrated contact form with email functionality</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="job">
            <h3>E-commerce Platform</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Developed a full-featured e-commerce application with shopping cart and payment integration</li>
                <li>Implemented user authentication and authorization</li>
                <li>Created admin dashboard for product and order management</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; color: #718096; font-size: 14px;">
        <em>This is a placeholder resume. Please replace with your actual resume content.</em>
    </p>
</body>
</html>
